00:45:58.553 --> 00:46:00.713
- My beloved Yale family,

00:46:01.790 --> 00:46:05.980
as we ready ourselves to
step out onto new ground

00:46:05.980 --> 00:46:10.980
in this daunting yet
inspiring liminal space

00:46:11.040 --> 00:46:13.710
of the unknown next.

00:46:13.710 --> 00:46:18.430
We begin a poignant turn
of goodbyes and hellos

00:46:18.430 --> 00:46:22.140
that invite laughter, tears, challenge,

00:46:22.140 --> 00:46:26.760
choice, discovery and pride.

00:46:26.760 --> 00:46:31.620
Let us go forth with deep
trust in certain knowledge

00:46:31.620 --> 00:46:35.283
that in this place every
one of us is welcome.

00:46:36.300 --> 00:46:41.300
That in this place we
will both stumble and soar

00:46:41.800 --> 00:46:46.250
that in this place love surrounds us,

00:46:46.250 --> 00:46:49.220
beauty can surprise us.

00:46:49.220 --> 00:46:54.220
In this place, light and truth awaits us.

00:46:54.500 --> 00:46:57.270
On this day and every day forward,

00:46:57.270 --> 00:47:00.900
may all that is holy shine upon us

00:47:00.900 --> 00:47:04.393
and tenderly bless our every breath,

00:47:05.400 --> 00:47:10.400
may we go in shalom, in salaam, in shanti,

00:47:12.100 --> 00:47:15.020
may we go in peace.

00:47:15.020 --> 00:47:16.133
Let us begin.

00:47:19.571 --> 00:47:22.821
(dramatic organ music)

00:47:35.062 --> 00:47:37.729
(gentle music)

